    {
      "bbox": [
        144,
        867,
        1944,
        1013
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I announced on February 17 the creation of an Office of\nJamaica Planning and Development and the appointment of G. Andrew\nMaguire as its Director.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3909,
          "min": -2.0301
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 34,
          "mean": -0.0062,
          "min": -0.2035
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 18368,
        "area_px": 244348,
        "density": 0.07517,
        "chars": 146,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.95
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        140,
        1051,
        1963,
        1337
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The establishment of this new office indicates the high\npriority I place on the various public actions underway, planned,\nor in prospect for the Jamaica area of Queens, one of the most\nimportant residential, transit, and retail centers in the City.\nA coordinated and comprehensive approach to the future development\nof this area is needed.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.374,
          "min": -2.0061
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 66,
          "mean": -0.0026,
          "min": -0.1641
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 43559,
        "area_px": 479290,
        "density": 0.09088,
        "chars": 339,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.78
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136,
        1377,
        1963,
        1665
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Last year this Administration decided that York College --\na new four-year college of the City University -- will be located\npermanently in South Jamaica. We must assure that temporary\nfacilities in Jamaica will be available for the college no later\nthan this fall. Meanwhile, the processing of the permanent site\nmust speedily move forward.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2992,
          "min": -1.6495
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 69,
          "mean": -0.0043,
          "min": -0.2867
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 40910,
        "area_px": 484300,
        "density": 0.08447,
        "chars": 341,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 8.34
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130,
        1703,
        2016,
        2171
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Other matters also require the City's attention. Sections\nof Jamaica have severe poverty problems. Public funds are available\nfor development in South Jamaica and will be used subject to the\ncommunity's determination of its own priorities. Plans are being\nmade to extend rapid transit systems to serve more adequately the\nentire community. Promising possibilities exist for the expansion\nof business and employment opportunities in this major metropolitan\nsub-center. Where appropriate, we will seek further federal and\nstate assistance consistent with our commitment to the revital-\nization of the Jamaica area.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3326,
          "min": -1.7038
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 112,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.1272
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 69374,
        "area_px": 809810,
        "density": 0.08567,
        "chars": 612,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 8.82
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124,
        2211,
        2006,
        2641
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The new Jamaica office, under Mr. Maguire, will coordinate\nand expedite actions of the administration in the Jamaica area.\nThe office will be responsible for working out an overall plan\nand development program for the area in which City departments and\nagencies will participate. Thus, agencies responsible for planning,\nphysical development, and public improvements are instructed to co-\nordinate their efforts and programs through the Jamaica office.\nAgencies responsible for services will give maximum cooperation\nto Mr. Maguire and the newly created office.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2965,
          "min": -1.6074
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 108,
          "mean": -0.0017,
          "min": -0.114
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 56884,
        "area_px": 740016,
        "density": 0.07687,
        "chars": 561,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.86
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        2679,
        2038,
        2873
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Mr. Maguire will also carry liaison responsibilities for the\nCity with the numerous public and quasi-public metropolitan and state\nagencies involved in matters pertaining to planning and physical\ndevelopment in the Jamaica area.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3016,
          "min": -1.5525
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0047
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 22460,
        "area_px": 270475,
        "density": 0.08304,
        "chars": 228,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.15
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110,
        2913,
        2038,
        3111
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Jamaica has tremendous potential. Its citizens are energetic\nand interested in their community. The new Jamaica Office reflects\nmy determination to achieve imaginative, effective, and orderly\ndevelopment there. I request your fullest cooperation.",
      "logprob_stats": {
